The response variability of the fluorescence time traces across stimulus repetitions was quantified using a response quality index67. This index is the signal-to-noise ratio given by \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
